      "title": "미국 FDA, 오젬픽과 제프바운드에 대한 새로운 안구 질환 위험 경고문 추가 발표",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dLMfe8Xn_SA/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"미국 FDA, 오젬픽과 제프바운드에 대한 새로운 안구 질환 위험 경고문 추가 발표\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">미국 FDA, 오젬픽과 제프바운드에 대한 새로운 안구 질환 위험 경고문 추가 발표 주제를 다룬 Reuters 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">non-arteritic anterior ischemic optic <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">neuropathy</mark> (NAION)<button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"non-arteritic anterior ischemic optic neuropathy\" aria-label=\"non-arteritic anterior ischemic optic neuropathy 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button></p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">비동맥염성 앞허혈성 시신경병증(NAION)</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. neuropathy: 신경병증, 신경 장애</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">non-arteritic anterior <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">ischemic</mark> optic neuropathy (NAION)<button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"non-arteritic anterior ischemic optic neuropathy\" aria-label=\"non-arteritic anterior ischemic optic neuropathy 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button></p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">비동맥염성 앞허혈성 시신경병증(NAION)</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. ischemic: 허혈성의, 혈류 부족의</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">It may lead to permanent <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">impairment</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"It may lead to permanent impairment of sight in some cases.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> of sight in some cases.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">이 질환은 경우에 따라 영구적인 시력 손상으로 이어질 수 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. impairment: 손상, (기능) 장애</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">but the <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">underlying</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"but the underlying cause is not completely understood.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> cause is not completely understood.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">그러나 근본적인 원인은 아직 완전히 밝혀지지 않았다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. underlying: 근본적인, 기저의</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">The health regulator said it has evaluated <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">clinical trial data</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"The health regulator said it has evaluated clinical trial data\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button></p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">보건 규제당국은 임상시험 데이터를 평가했다고 밝혔다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. clinical trial data: 임상시험 데이터</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\"><mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">glycemic</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"glycemic, cardiovascular, renal, and sleep apnea benefits.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button>, cardiovascular, renal, and sleep apnea benefits.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">혈당 조절, 심혈관 건강, 신장 보호 및 수면무호흡증 개선 효과.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. glycemic: 혈당의</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dLMfe8Xn_SA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">Reuters | US FDA orders new eye risk warnings for Ozempic, Zepbound | By Reuters</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2026/11/09/health/glp1-vision-loss-fda-warning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
